      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## About FLUX.2 [dev]\n\n[FLUX.2 [dev]](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-dev) (Black Forest Labs, 32B, Mistral Small 3 text\nencoder): text-to-image with strong prompt following and in-image text. Write full descriptive sentences; put literal\ntext in quotes. There is no negative prompt: dev runs with embedded guidance (**FluxGuidance**), not true CFG.\n\n**Settings**: 28 steps (50 for finals), guidance 2.5–4 (4 here), euler, `Flux2Scheduler`, 1024×1024 (multiples of 16).\n**Width** and **Height** feed both the latent and the scheduler, whose shift depends on the image size.\n\n## Image Bench\n\nThe node titles carry Image Bench markers:\n\n| Marker | Node | Generate tab |\n|--------|------|--------------|\n| `ib:cp` | Load Diffusion Model | model list |\n| `ib:pp` | Image Bench Prompt | prompt and LoRA list |\n| `ib:smp` | SamplerCustomAdvanced | seed (RandomNoise), steps (Flux2Scheduler), sampling method (KSamplerSelect), Distilled CFG (FluxGuidance), size (Width / Height) |\n| `ib:lora` | Load LoRA (bypassed) | — (LoRA exploration only) |\n\n**LoRAs**: check them in the LoRA list of the Generate tab, or type `<lora:name:weight>` into the prompt.\nThe **Image Bench Prompt** node applies them and passes the prompt on without the tags.\n**Load LoRA** stays bypassed; LoRA exploration enables it for its runs and bypasses it again afterwards.\n\n## Model Links\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [flux2_dev_fp8mixed.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/flux2_dev_fp8mixed.safetensors)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [mistral_3_small_flux2_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/mistral_3_small_flux2_bf16.safetensors)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [full_encoder_small_decoder.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-small-decoder/resolve/main/full_encoder_small_decoder.safetensors)\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n└── 📂 models/\n    ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n    │   └── flux2_dev_fp8mixed.safetensors\n    ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n    │   └── mistral_3_small_flux2_bf16.safetensors\n    └── 📂 vae/\n        └── full_encoder_small_decoder.safetensors\n```\n"
      ],
      "title": "Note: FLUX.2 [dev]",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
